    "https://central.edu/academics/academic-success-deans/": {
      "title": "Academics",
      "description": "Academic Success Deans | Academics | Central College Skip to main content Central College logo Admission Apply to Central Visit Campus Deposit Now Financial Aid Scholarships Tuition Price Admission Requirements Contact Us Dates and Deadlines Fast Facts International Students Outcomes Request Info Admission Ambassadors Student Profiles Transfer Students Academics Majors Academic Calendar Academic Programs Career Development Academic Success Deans Commencement Community Service Core Requirements Course Catalog & Schedule of Courses Faculty Fine Arts Geisler Library Honors (Emerging Scholars) Off-Campus Experiences Pre-Health Registrar’s Office Transcripts Campus Life Campus Dining Campus Map BELONG at Central Faith Fine Arts Frequent Questions Get Involved Health & Safety Life in Pella Living on Campus Move-In Guide Parent Info Student Handbook Student Senate Student Services Traditions Contact Us Alumni Stay Connected Initiatives Events Update Us Endowment Planned Giving Central Red Handshake Journey Scholarship Fund Ways to Give Dutchology Be The Good – Dutch Letter Homecoming Commencement Transcripts Imagine More A World of Good Athletics Sports Recruit Me Central Dutch Network Calendar Athletic Training Beyond Central Camps & Clinics Central Close-Up Central Club Facilities Hall of Honor Staff Directory Strength & Conditioning Spirit Shoppe Under Armour About Directory Events News Dutchology Apply Visit Tour Give About Directory Events News Dutchology Apply Visit Tour Give Central College logo Admission Apply to Central Visit Campus Deposit Now Financial Aid Scholarships Tuition Price Admission Requirements Contact Us Dates and Deadlines Fast Facts International Students Outcomes Request Info Admission Ambassadors Student Profiles Transfer Students Academics Majors Academic Calendar Academic Programs Career Development Academic Success Deans Commencement Community Service Core Requirements Course Catalog & Schedule of Courses Faculty Fine Arts Geisler Library Honors (Emerging Scholars) Off-Campus Experiences Pre-Health Registrar’s Office Transcripts Campus Life Campus Dining Campus Map BELONG at Central Faith Fine Arts Frequent Questions Get Involved Health & Safety Life in Pella Living on Campus Move-In Guide Parent Info Student Handbook Student Senate Student Services Traditions Contact Us Alumni Stay Connected Initiatives Events Update Us Endowment Planned Giving Central Red Handshake Journey Scholarship Fund Ways to Give Dutchology Be The Good – Dutch Letter Homecoming Commencement Transcripts Imagine More A World of Good Athletics Sports Recruit Me Central Dutch Network Calendar Athletic Training Beyond Central Camps & Clinics Central Close-Up Central Club Facilities Hall of Honor Staff Directory Strength & Conditioning Spirit Shoppe Under Armour Helpful Links: Academic Calendar Course Catalog Deposit Dutchology Majors & Programs myCentral Registrar Tuition About Directory Events News Apply Visit Tour Give Academics home / Academics / Academic Success Deans Academic Success Deans Meet Central College’s academic success deans: Jeremy Burke, Óscar Reynaga and Amy Young These incredible faculty members are there to support students throughout their time at Central. Starting at orientation and continuing through graduation, academic success deans are there to celebrate your achievements, answer questions, locate resources and navigate challenges. Get to know these important, awesome resources who want to connect and enrich your Central experience! Academic Success Dean — Jeremy Burke Jeremy Burke Pre-Health Advisor burkej@central.edu Jeremy Burke , pre-health advisor and fellowship advisor, joined the Career Development and Civic Engagement team in 2021. Burke has a Bachelor of Arts degree in philosophy and a Bachelor of Science in environmental biology from St. Ambrose University in Davenport, Iowa. He went on to earn a master’s degree in philosophy from Washington University in St. Louis, Missouri, and an MFA in creative writing (poetry) from University of New Orleans. Burke has many years of advising students in pre-health programs including medicine, dentistry, pharmacy, genetic counseling, physician assistant, public health, veterinary medicine and optometry. Since 1999, he also has served as a writing tutor, honors student advisor and associate director of general education. In addition to numerous publications and awards in poetry, Burke has taught courses at St. Ambrose University, University of the Holy Cross in New Orleans, Louisiana, and Loyola University New Orleans. Academic Success Dean — Óscar Reynaga Oscar Reynaga Senior Lecturer of Spanish reynagao@central.edu Óscar Reynaga , senior lecturer of Spanish , received his B.A. degree in psychology and Spanish from the University of California Berkeley and his M.A. in Spanish from University of Iowa. He joined the department of modern languages at Central College in 2007. In addition to teaching Spanish and “Hispanics/Latinos in the U.S.,” he has taught an honors seminar, Intersections and co-developed short-term off-campus experiences for Central students in Mérida and Peru. Academic Success Dean — Amy Young Amy Young Coordinator of ADA Accommodations younga@central.edu Amy Young , associate professor of German , has a bachelor’s degree in German and political science from Simpson College. She earned her master’s degree from Bowling Green State University and her doctorate from the University of Nebraska-Lincoln. Young has taught at Central since 2008 with an emphasis on 20th century German and Austrian literature and culture, women’s and gender studies, sustainability and translation. Her service to Central also includes as intersections director (2017-2019); election to the Personnel Committee and former International Programs Committee; appointment as faculty representative to the Board of Trustees ; and three years on the former campus life committee, including a term as chair and one as secretary. Academics Majors Academic Calendar Academic Programs Career Development Academic Success Deans Commencement Community Service Core Requirements Course Catalog & Schedule of Courses Faculty Fine Arts Geisler Library Honors (Emerging Scholars) Off-Campus Experiences Pre-Health Registrar’s Office Transcripts Request Information We're excited you're interested in Central! Submit your request and we’ll make sure you don’t miss any information about campus visit events, scholarship opportunities and more. Request Info Loading... This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. Footer Quicklinks Academic Calendar Bookstore Brand Guidelines Campus Map Catering Services Central Dutch Network Commencement Conferences & Events Dutchology Employment Events Calendar Library Media Contacts Mission myCentral News Policies Pre-College Programs Safety Spirit Shoppe Title IX Central College Site 877-462-3687 641-416-4414 812 University St. Pella, Iowa 50219 admission@central.edu © Central College 2026 Privacy Policy"
