    "https://recruiting.paylocity.com/recruiting/jobs/Details/4398249/Central-College/Student-Admission-Representative-Intern": {
      "title": "In order to use this site, it is necessary to enable JavaScript.",
      "description": "Central College - Student Admission Representative Intern In order to use this site, it is necessary to enable JavaScript. Here are the instructions how to enable JavaScript in your web browser . All Jobs > Student Admission Representative Intern Central College Apply Student Admission Representative Intern PELLA, IA • Admission Apply Job Type Part-time Description Interested in learning more about a career in college admission? The Admission Counselor Intern position is a great opportunity to gain hands-on experience while representing Central and supporting the recruitment of future students. As an intern, you’ll work alongside the admission team to learn about the admission counselor profession, assist with student outreach, and help create welcoming experiences for prospective students and their families. This role offers valuable professional development while allowing you to share what makes Central special. If you’re a strong communicator, dependable, and excited to represent the college, this opportunity is a great way to build leadership skills and explore a career in college admission. Time Commitment: September 15 - December 1, 2026 Apply View All Jobs Powered by Privacy Policy | Payroll & HR Software Central College: Privacy Policy"
    },
