 Library Honors (Emerging Scholars) Off-Campus Experiences Pre-Health Registrar’s Office Transcripts Campus Life Campus Dining Campus Map BELONG at Central Faith Fine Arts Frequent Questions Get Involved Health & Safety Life in Pella Living on Campus Move-In Guide Parent Info Student Handbook Student Senate Student Services Traditions Contact Us Alumni Stay Connected Initiatives Events Update Us Endowment Planned Giving Central Red Handshake Journey Scholarship Fund Ways to Give Dutchology Be The Good – Dutch Letter Homecoming Commencement Transcripts Imagine More A World of Good Athletics Sports Recruit Me Central Dutch Network Calendar Athletic Training Beyond Central Camps & Clinics Central Close-Up Central Club Facilities Hall of Honor Staff Directory Strength & Conditioning Spirit Shoppe Under Armour Helpful Links: Academic Calendar Course Catalog Deposit Dutchology Majors & Programs myCentral Registrar Tuition About Directory Events News Apply Visit Tour Give Job Seekers home / Job Seekers / Our Purpose Our Purpose The mission of the Central College Human Resource department is to support the overall mission and goals of the college by: Recruiting and retaining qualified college staff and student employees; promoting a work environment of respect where each person is treated consistently and appreciated for their skills and abilities; serving the faculty and staff by providing a comprehensive benefit package; educating faculty and staff on the availability and use of such benefits; and providing developmental opportunities and employment related services for college staff and student employees. When our staff is highly valued, treated with fairness, respect and dignity, these values will filter through the community—thus leading our students by example. Contact us Email: humanresources@central.edu Phone: 641-628-5199 Fax: 641-628-5374 Job Seekers Benefits Information about Central Returning Applicants Policies Our Ethos Our Purpose Behind the Lens Katie Bower ’27, sports photographer and softball player from Kansas City, Missouri, captures the best moments of Central College athletics — both behind the lens and on the field. Whether she’s snapping action shots or stepping up to the plate, she’s passionate about telling the Central Dutch story. Read More Request Information We're excited you're interested in Central! Submit your request and we’ll make sure you don’t miss any information about campus visit events, scholarship opportunities and more. Request Info Loading... This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. Footer Quicklinks Academic Calendar Bookstore Brand Guidelines Campus Map Catering Services Central Dutch Network Commencement Conferences & Events Dutchology Employment Events Calendar Library Media Contacts Mission myCentral News Policies Pre-College Programs Safety Spirit Shoppe Title IX Central College Site 877-462-3687 641-416-4414 812 University St. Pella, Iowa 50219 admission@central.edu © Central College 2026 Privacy Policy"
